/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4;"&gt;金融影响者尼古拉斯·克朗。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-style: italic;"&gt;摄影师：泰勒·格拉斯科克&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;多年来，&lt;/strong&gt;税收优化投资策略仅限于对冲基金和能够获得专门财务规划的超级富裕家庭。现在，它们正在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/h4tDYaYBYTF9gSwU6M-QwB7-YtlU91um31vitQcu-RUEXaFTaSYuBEMgJ3Ezy2jKUZGpL7SYLKaNARVJovLDZY1BlL-rQcJcClOvOUb2eGkFNnvy24uOYgD1bMdlh2FTZEe-iybDwYmw7IhTafKtdxtJlLmd2kXxD57d7xx_D9wklyGt_JYuKtvSLgg8CBOH2dWTfDLj7nBkwHf_xKJsBnbLig-mihTBU5ibasfhLE5soKUCPdlfnaCbjFhBEY0tFs010ba1kzoT-1vIHsGsSxqferuqUPpcD6HDQCdeMqT9SKmDkHSbMvaP5oUXedroSnL-gWKliqV1oktlYqZWFVebta1HJKTXZp1FBBF-erQ_a9y3Cg7yaSyV6wR3WJiFm05ZlstFB-uQkkAaL4ft_QRueY2GAMZXyAb0A7_25xbALlD8J8rKH6pykzY5RYuAU6TUkqI0uCmfgQ6PN_oeQ8DVQ9PFd9gGELjts6jAwT_xDBmI1V2IRe5fYq1J/MN8bpAJlySd8pEoxwvTZ0GBWkaqIpbcN/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="TikTok 影响者正在向日常投资者推销超富裕人士的税务手册"&gt;YouTube 和 TikTok&lt;/a&gt;上向大众推销。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style="margin-top: 24px; padding-inline-start: 24px;"&gt;&lt;li style="font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;财富顾问&lt;/strong&gt;和金融影响者正在利用社交媒体兜售&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/GMkvjzr4Zp7Tk2gb0HNCS9qriZKdJIwvmAtPX4CDolIECbptoTu10yV7zmvcdo6u1in-7UaC20Zj0CfT3ExjuS_xSJnWIhOW3qn3g4vZyPrcmgSFeas_eNfuj_uPYS6iB2vskfAok40tvdu5GmlKV1FshkrltjCZLh_BFlihRP_PxyDsh5w9SphxbaEiIS2EWbtSFSlzuNMXvoj95jxoymo_3fEiGJvUOUSmx39F9t-KNKbEcp2Fi2-VRBNoESDBgYMbWdLh2AkZ6kAcVmxIEtodTLYmxn4uUC1G7MR-WXgzVq9fX703DN0K6rh-4LECRPGQH3NYXk509hZe5AOygOnnJakSxRwimWcU9lZ9bdAeEeFYA0M-aKyIa_icAur2Btxgf6bX1Z8FVmF5rAPYGrLaabt6ARikMQ9Ponab_qvHhTUpEDUhI2xNcivS0OuOyoBoaAAtD7rZg0fnxuZs2ctOylZaRxX1XLTyXvrnbv3NSYHkldwQuDHn9tdFQbRAZsXYKg/T3G0rRwnkY_Z2_LRY9pFEO0Vtr-Xqa5_/23" rel="noo